From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:22:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on the Dell Inspiron
 14 Plus 5441

The Inspiron 14 Plus 5441's tree is built on the Inspiron 14 Plus 7441's
board (x1-dell-thena.dtsi), and the 7441 is already on the list. Without
QSEECOM the laptop has no EFI variables, so an installer cannot write its
boot entry.
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index f1bd478..d8e66b7 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2308,6 +2308,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407ra" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a16-ux3607oa" },
+	{ .compatible = "dell,inspiron-14-plus-5441" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,inspiron-14-plus-7441" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,latitude-5455" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,latitude-7455" },
-- 
2.56.0

